<%# ダッシュボード: 売上レポート（合計・支払方法・税率・日別・月別・担当者・商品・客層）。初期表示は今月 %>
<%= page_header "売上レポート" do %>
  <%= link_to dashboard_reports_path(format: :csv, store_id: params[:store_id], from: params[:from], to: params[:to]), class: "btn btn-secondary", data: { turbo: false } do %><%= icon(:download, size: 18) %>CSVで出力<% end %>
<% end %>
<%= render layout: "dashboard/shared/filter", locals: { url: dashboard_reports_path, stores: @stores, submit: "集計する" } do |f| %><% end %>

<% if @daily_summary.empty? && @product_ranking.empty? %>
  <%= empty_message("この条件の売上はありません。期間を広げてみてください。") %>
<% end %>

<div class="kpis">
  <div class="kpi"><div class="kpi-label">売上の合計</div><div class="kpi-value"><%= yen(@total_sales_amount) %></div></div>
  <div class="kpi"><div class="kpi-label">会計の件数</div><div class="kpi-value"><%= number_with_delimiter(@total_sales_count) %><small>件</small></div></div>
  <div class="kpi"><div class="kpi-label">客単価</div><div class="kpi-value"><%= @total_sales_count.positive? ? yen(@total_sales_amount / @total_sales_count) : "-" %></div></div>
  <div class="kpi"><div class="kpi-label">値引きの合計</div><div class="kpi-value"><%= @total_discount.positive? ? "-#{yen(@total_discount)}" : yen(0) %></div></div>
</div>

<%# 見出し → 列名 → 行。行がないものは表示しない %>
<% sections = [
     [ "日次売上", [ "日付", "件数", "売上金額" ], @daily_summary.map { |r| [ l(r[:day], format: :long), "#{r[:count]}件", yen(r[:amount]) ] } ],
     [ "月次売上", [ "年月", "件数", "売上金額" ], (@monthly_summary.size > 1 ? @monthly_summary : []).map { |r| [ r[:month], "#{r[:count]}件", yen(r[:amount]) ] } ],
     [ "支払い方法別集計", [ "支払い方法", "件数", "金額" ], @payment_summary.map { |r| [ r[:label], "#{r[:count]}件", yen(r[:amount]) ] } ],
     [ "税率別売上", [ "税率", "売上（税込）", "うち消費税", "返品（税込）", "差引の売上（税込）", "差引の消費税" ], @tax_summary.map { |r| [ "#{r[:tax_rate]}%", *r.values_at(:sales_amount, :sales_tax, :refund_amount, :net_amount, :net_tax).map { |v| yen(v) } ] } ],
     [ "返品・取消", [ "区分", "件数", "金額" ], (@refund_count.to_i + @void_count.to_i).positive? ? [ [ "返品", "#{@refund_count}件", yen(@refund_total) ], [ "会計の取消", "#{@void_count}件", yen(@void_total) ] ] : [] ],
     [ "担当者別売上", [ "従業員番号", "担当者名", "件数", "売上金額" ], @employee_summary.map { |r| [ r[:code], r[:name], "#{r[:count]}件", yen(r[:amount]) ] } ],
     [ "商品別売上ランキング（上位20件）", [ "順位", "商品名", "販売数", "売上金額" ], @product_ranking.each_with_index.map { |r, i| [ i + 1, r[:name], "#{r[:quantity]}個", yen(r[:amount]) ] } ],
     [ "客層キー別売上", [ "性別", "年代", "件数", "売上金額" ], @customer_segment_summary.map { |r| [ r[:gender], r[:age_group], "#{r[:count]}件", yen(r[:amount]) ] } ]
   ].select { |_, _, rows| rows.any? } %>
<% if sections.size > 1 %>
  <nav class="chips" aria-label="このページの目次" style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem"><% sections.each_with_index do |(title, *), i| %><%= link_to title, "#report-#{i}", class: "chip" %><% end %></nav>
<% end %>
<% sections.each_with_index do |(title, headers, rows), i| %>
  <section id="report-<%= i %>"><h3><%= title %></h3><%= data_table(headers, rows) %></section>
<% end %>
